<section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="hiw-header">
    <h2 class="section-title">How SATrack Works Under the Hood</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">From raw text to intelligent retrieval — here's the AI pipeline in five steps.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="hiw-steps">

    <div class="hiw-step">
      <div class="hiw-step-visual">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 320 180" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Query input">
