          <circle cx="140" cy="110" r="3" fill="#64748B" opacity="0.4"/>
          <circle cx="220" cy="120" r="3" fill="#64748B" opacity="0.4"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="85" r="3" fill="#64748B" opacity="0.4"/>
          <circle cx="250" cy="70" r="3" fill="#64748B" opacity="0.4"/>
          <circle cx="170" cy="130" r="3" fill="#64748B" opacity="0.4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="hiw-step-text">
        <span class="hiw-step-num">3</span>
        <h3>Mapped into vector space</h3>
        <p>Every word becomes a point in a <strong>high-dimensional space</strong> where position encodes meaning — similar words land near each other</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hiw-step">
      <div class="hiw-step-visual">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 320 180" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Vector database">
